# Allowlist for container build context
# Only include what the build needs, excluding everything else.
# This prevents the 526 MB project root (including .venv, docs, etc.)
# from being transferred to the build context.
#
# Last-matching-line-wins: `*` excludes all, then `!` re-includes specific paths.

# Exclude everything by default
*

# Re-include what the build needs
!pyproject.toml
!wheels
!tests

# Re-include tests/container specifically (need to walk down the tree)
tests/*
!tests/container
